  'Clash detection': '碰撞检测', 'Search sets, hard and clearance clash tests between them, the clashes followed from run to run, BCF.': '搜索集、它们之间的硬碰撞和间隙碰撞测试、逐次运行跟踪碰撞、BCF。', 'Clash test': '碰撞测试', 'New test': '新建测试', 'not run yet': '尚未运行', 'Test': '测试', 'Search sets': '搜索集', 'No clash test yet.': '尚无碰撞测试。', 'Status of the selected clashes': '所选碰撞的状态', 'Status…': '状态…', 'Run test': '运行测试', 'Run all': '全部运行', 'Each open clash (or those selected) a remark of type Clash with its viewpoint, sent as a BCF file; sent again: the same remarks updated': '每个未解决的碰撞（或所选的）生成一条类型为碰撞、含其视点的意见，以 BCF 文件发送；再次发送：更新同样的意见', 'Testing…': '正在测试…', 'Make a search set first.': '请先建立搜索集。', 'Out of date: the model has changed since this run. Run the test again.': '已过期：自上次运行以来模型已更改。请重新运行测试。', 'Stopped at the limit of 10,000 clashes: tighten the sets or the tolerance.': '已在 10,000 个碰撞的上限处停止：请收紧搜索集或容差。', 'Run test runs it once and keeps what it finds here.': '运行测试会运行一次，并将结果保存在此。', 'No clash.': '无碰撞。', 'Element A': '元素 A', 'Element B': '元素 B', 'Distance (mm)': '距离 (mm)', 'Reviewed': '已审阅', 'Approved': '已批准', 'Set A': '集 A', 'Set B': '集 B', 'Set A against itself': '集 A 与自身', 'Hard: elements crossing': '硬碰撞：元素相交', 'Clearance: closer than a distance': '间隙：距离小于指定值', 'A crossing this deep or less is not a clash': '相交深度不超过此值时不算碰撞', 'Elements closer than this clash': '距离小于此值的元素视为碰撞', 'takes this test': '采用此测试', 'Changing the sets or the kind starts the test\'s clashes afresh. Never tested: an element and what fills its openings, the parts of one assembly, elements joined or attached to each other.': '更改搜索集或类型将重新开始该测试的碰撞。以下情况从不测试：元素与填充其洞口的构件、同一组件的各部分、相互连接或附着的元素。', 'Delete test': '删除测试', 'Search set': '搜索集', 'Takes': '包含', 'elements meeting any rule': '满足任一规则的元素', 'elements meeting every rule': '满足所有规则的元素', 'Operator': '运算符', 'Linked file': '链接文件', 'Parameter': '参数', 'is': '等于', 'is one of': '属于其中之一', 'is not': '不等于', 'is not any of': '不属于其中任何一个', 'contains': '包含', 'does not contain': '不包含', 'between': '介于', 'name': '名称', 'values, by commas': '值，以逗号分隔', 'value': '值', 'Remove the rule': '移除规则', 'A class is its IFC name (IfcWall) or its label (Wall). A "not" rule takes elements out. With no rule adding elements, the set holds everything.': '类别即其 IFC 名称 (IfcWall) 或其标签（墙）。“非”规则会剔除元素。没有添加元素的规则时，集合包含全部元素。',
  "Zoom to cursor": "缩放至光标", "Orbit around selection": "绕所选对象旋转", "The wheel zooms to the point under the cursor.": "滚轮缩放至光标下的点。", "The wheel zooms to the middle of the 3D view.": "滚轮缩放至三维视图中心。", "The 3D view orbits round the selection, or the point under the cursor.": "三维视图绕所选对象或光标下的点旋转。", "The 3D view orbits round its middle.": "三维视图绕其中心旋转。", "The mouse wheel zooms to the point of the model under the cursor, which stays where it is (View → Zoom to cursor); off, to the middle of the view": "鼠标滚轮缩放至光标下的模型点，该点位置保持不变（视图 → 缩放至光标）；关闭时，缩放至视图中心", "A drag turns the view round the selection's middle, else round the point of the model under the cursor (View → Orbit around selection); off, round the middle of the view": "拖动使视图绕所选对象的中心旋转，否则绕光标下的模型点旋转（视图 → 绕所选对象旋转）；关闭时，绕视图中心旋转",
