  // A view's level of development, LOD 100 to 400 (decision 404)
  "Level of development": "发展程度（LOD）", "How much of the model the view draws, never by its scale: LOD 100 · massing: Walls, floors and roofs one outline hatched as their core; steel members as their axes; doors and windows as their opening and swing. LOD 200 · layers: The layers of walls, floors and roofs; doors' and windows' frames and sashes, simplified. LOD 300 · details: The details of doors and windows (reveals, sills, surrounds, thresholds, boards, hardware, shutters) and the openings' linings. LOD 350 · connections: Steel connections: plates, bolts, anchors. LOD 400 · fabrication: A linked structural model's reinforcing bars.": "视图绘制模型的程度，从不取决于比例：LOD 100 · 体量: 墙、楼板和屋顶为一个轮廓，按核心层填充；钢构件为其轴线；门窗为洞口及开启线. LOD 200 · 分层: 墙、楼板和屋顶的分层；门窗框与扇，简化. LOD 300 · 细部: 门窗细部（窗洞侧面、窗台、套框、门槛、窗台板、五金、百叶）及洞口衬板. LOD 350 · 连接: 钢连接：板件、螺栓、锚栓. LOD 400 · 加工: 链接结构模型的钢筋.", "LOD 100 · massing": "LOD 100 · 体量", "LOD 200 · layers": "LOD 200 · 分层", "LOD 300 · details": "LOD 300 · 细部", "LOD 350 · connections": "LOD 350 · 连接", "LOD 400 · fabrication": "LOD 400 · 加工",
